{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-20","kind":"proposition","title":"以三角形分相似之多边直线形则分数必等而相当之各三角形各相似其各相当两三角形…","englishTitle":"Similar polygons are divided into similar triangles, and into triangles equal in multitude and in the same ratio as the wholes, and the polygon has to the polygon a ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side.","book":6,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","contentId":"euclid-6-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cf464e5108de92b2665705e4fea793e9ed5a0b5f63f9a27da138b55fe2662f8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-20.statement","euclid-6-20.construction.1","euclid-6-20.construction.2","euclid-6-20.proof.1","euclid-6-20.proof.2","euclid-6-20.proof.3","euclid-6-20.proof.4","euclid-6-20.proof.5","euclid-6-20.proof.6","euclid-6-20.proof.7","euclid-6-20.construction.3","euclid-6-20.proof.8","euclid-6-20.proof.9","euclid-6-20.proof.10","euclid-6-20.proof.11","euclid-6-20.proof.12","euclid-6-20.proof.13","euclid-6-20.proof.14","euclid-6-20.proof.15","euclid-6-20.proof.16","euclid-6-20.proof.17","euclid-6-20.proof.18","euclid-6-20.proof.19","euclid-6-20.proof.20","euclid-6-20.proof.21","euclid-6-20.conclusion","euclid-6-20.historical.1","euclid-6-20.historical.2","euclid-6-20.historical.3","euclid-6-20.historical.4","euclid-6-20.historical.5","euclid-6-20.historical.6","euclid-6-20.historical.7","euclid-6-20.historical.8","euclid-6-20.historical.9","euclid-6-20.historical.10","euclid-6-20.historical.11","euclid-6-20.historical.12","euclid-6-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3adc4279f17b603f8833938c29e9aeea6ebcba0d15058d6b183a73b38cc39539","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar polygons are divided into similar triangles, and into triangles equal in multitude and in the same ratio as the wholes, and the polygon has to the polygon a ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相似多边形可以分成数量相等且对应相似的三角形；对应三角形的面积之比等于原多边形的面积之比，而相似多边形的面积之比等于对应边长之比的平方。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"以三角形分相似之多边直线形则分数必等而相当之各三角形各相似其各相当两三角形之比例若两元形之比例其元形之比例为两相似边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把两个相似的直线多边形分别分成三角形时，分出的三角形个数相同，相对应的三角形彼此相似；对应三角形的面积之比等于两个多边形的面积之比。两个相似多边形的面积之比，等于它们对应边长度之比的平方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5e996bf75a63a41f72a93b35293451eac2815d35d33c40335e21c476ef3d41e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDE, FGHKL be similar polygons, and let AB correspond to FG; I say that the polygons ABCDE, FGHKL are divided into similar triangles, and into triangles equal in multitude and in the same ratio as the wholes, and the polygon ABCDE has to the polygon FGHKL a ratio duplicate of that which AB has to FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDE,FGHKL类似多边形,AB对应FG;我说,多边形,ABCDE,FGHKL被分为类似的三角形,三角形的成份和整体比例相同,多边形,ABCDE的比例与AB的比例的多边形,FGHKL的比例是FG的比例的重复。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a135e08812ddf736bd361248d7789b4d2c5f50d2a1cda78ff6fec37d4bdb0589","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BE, EC, GL, LH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE,EC,GL,LH连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ebcf0efd0a8cc6ed3f7eada58bc895315055fac3ffa25fd9f49c69ab9fac573","citations":["euclid-6-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the polygon ABCDE is similar to the polygon FGHKL, the angle BAE is equal to the angle GFL; and, as BA is to AE, so is GF to FL. [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于多边形 ABCDE与多边形 FGHKL相似,BAE角等于GFL角;BA-AE比等于GF-FL比；BA 与 AE 之比等于 GF 与 FL 之比。 [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"075ff09112fb89841cbfc65c9c9e78194690998bb903fddb88dd937583cc03cf","citations":["euclid-6-6","euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then ABE, FGL are two triangles having one angle equal to one angle and the sides about the equal angles proportional, therefore the triangle ABE is equiangular with the triangle FGL; [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] so that it is also similar; [[VI. 4 and Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore the angle ABE is equal to the angle FGL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,FGL是两个三角形,一个角度等于一个角度,两个角度等于成比例,因此三角形ABE与三角形FGL是等角;因此,角ABE也与角FGL相似;因此,角ABE等于角FGL。 [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] [[VI. 4 and Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56be61664929c2255711c281a79ba67755a600e55f032052a5a7209d47ca6a9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the whole angle ABC is also equal to the whole angle FGH because of the similarity of the polygons; therefore the remaining angle EBC is equal to the angle LGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于多边形的相似性,整个ABC角也等于整个FGH角;因此,其余的EBC角等于LGH角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99361f755d8b204fa18a02b753844921c163b6d5b2097615866b114a3b80b61f","citations":["euclid-5-22","euclid-6-6","euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, because of the similarity of the triangles ABE, FGL, as EB is to BA, so is LG to GF, and moreover also, because of the similarity of the polygons, as AB is to BC, so is FG to GH, therefore, ex aequali, as EB is to BC, so is LG to GH; [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)] that is, the sides about the equal angles EBC, LGH are proportional; therefore the triangle EBC is equiangular with the triangle LGH, [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] so that the triangle EBC is also similar to the triangle LGH. [[VI. 4 and Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于三角形ABE、FGL的相似性,EB比BA等于LG比GF,此外,由于多边形的相似性,AB比BC等于FG比GH,因此,在平等的情况下,EB比BC等于LG比GH;也就是说,平等角度EBC对LGH对成比例;因此,三角形EBC是同三角形LGH的等角形,因此三角形EBC也与三角形LGH类似；EB 与 BA 之比等于 LG 与 GF 之比；AB 与 BC 之比等于 FG 与 GH 之比；EB 与 BC 之比等于 LG 与 GH 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)] [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] [[VI. 4 and Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e785b6049b61fa68002ac2adf58d037909460c3bdcd4d9684c12cdba415fec3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle ECD is also similar to the triangle LHK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形ECD也与三角形LHK类似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff30313a086aaf5b842d1491c529560c08ead8377d3045f134808e94abdf07c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the similar polygons ABCDE, FGHKL have been divided into similar triangles, and into triangles equal in multitude."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,类似的多边形 ABCDE FGHKL 被分成类似的三角形,并分为相同多的三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e700788538935da29fdfa7c4fc563ebcc91d06f1f75bc29fecdde066599f94a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that they are also in the same ratio as the wholes, that is, in such manner that the triangles are proportional, and ABE, EBC, ECD are antecedents, while FGL, LGH, LHK are their consequents, and that the polygon ABCDE has to the polygon FGHKL a ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side has to the corresponding side, that is AB to FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们与整体的比例相同,即三角形为成比例,ABE,EBC,ECD是先兆,而后兆为FGL,LGH,LHK,多边形,ABCDE是相应方与相应方之比的多边形,FGHKL的复数,即AB至FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa46b28d445e0004819909b38e3194bcb569ef212bb641220020185be87a5c72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AC, FH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,FH连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66d0b51827fc3e5b539bc1a41f70ddf2882611188b23c686e5ad6c9e65ba0dac","citations":["euclid-6-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, because of the similarity of the polygons, the angle ABC is equal to the angle FGH, and, as AB is to BC, so is FG to GH, the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle FGH; [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] therefore the angle BAC is equal to the angle GFH, and the angle BCA to the angle GHF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于多边形的相似性,ABC角等于FGH角,AB至BC角等于FG至GH角,三角形ABC是三角形FGH的等角;因此,BAC角等于角GFH,而角BCA等于角GHF；AB 与 BC 之比等于 FG 与 GH 之比。 [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7b4ea97b3eed03f49e4ad043fb1a026e8b55c5916f89adafcc3030fd7b8cef3","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle BAM is equal to the angle GFN, and the angle ABM is also equal to the angle FGN, therefore the remaining angle AMB is also equal to the remaining angle FNG; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle ABM is equiangular with the triangle FGN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于角度BAM等于角度GFN,而角度ABM也等于角度FGN,因此剩余角度AMB也等于剩余角度FNG;因此三角形ABM与三角形FGN等量。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2f9e47c904888e0467ad62bc07fdc026875fe36609cba75cc8ea5872ae177a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the triangle BMC is also equiangular with the triangle GNH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明三角形BMC也是与三角形GNH的对角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"236f3e7d46ff11474583d2ed2d07a51edc66e86111cb388e871bde8f3308b77c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as AM is to MB, so is FN to NG, and, as BM is to MC, so is GN to NH; so that, in addition, ex aequali, as AM is to MC, so is FN to NH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AM比MB的比例相当于FN比NG,BM比MC的比例等于GN比NH;因此,在平等的情况下,AM比MC的比例等于FN比NH；AM 与 MB 之比等于 FN 与 NG 之比；BM 与 MC 之比等于 GN 与 NH 之比；AM 与 MC 之比等于 FN 与 NH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"793c06a156352c4b62753a315c842caea2d074f8bca3e87e56e4c3dbdb335c08","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AM is to MC, so is the triangle ABM to MBC, and AME to EMC; for they are to one another as their bases. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AM对MC的比等于三角ABM对MBC和AME对EMC的比;因为它们是彼此作为底边的比；AM 与 MC 之比等于 ABM 与 MBC 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c2562ceb9d04f461745f9cc35f9171b620029738f9a0203d8a630662ba9bd6f","citations":["euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so are all the antecedents to all the consequents; [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)] therefore, as the triangle AMB is to BMC, so is ABE to CBE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,由于前例之一与后例之一相同,所有后例的前例也相同;因此,三角形AMB对BMC的比等于ABE对CBE的比；AMB 与 BMC 之比等于 ABE 与 CBE 之比。 [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"878cae6f33f8114f12b0b8ee6fd67b71454a3eb7fcc16b3183563d0a579ed60c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AMB is to BMC, so is AM to MC; therefore also, as AM is to MC, so is the triangle ABE to the triangle EBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AMB对BMC的比等于AM对MC的比;因此,AM对MC的比等于三角ABE对三角EBC的比；AMB 与 BMC 之比等于 AM 与 MC 之比；AM 与 MC 之比等于 ABE 与 EBC 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2e64550a33d8ba1caef1843ee55aacc13aabbd3a1f11bd0c390f726ed3e0561","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as FN is to NH, so is the triangle FGL to the triangle GLH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,FN比NH的比例等于三角FGL对三角GLH的比；FN 与 NH 之比等于 FGL 与 GLH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58eba3704f295e871a3447e354aeea91e3cb9d5763e001a268b0fc8df97822d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as AM is to MC, so is FN to NH; therefore also, as the triangle ABE is to the triangle BEC, so is the triangle FGL to the triangle GLH; and, alternately, as the triangle ABE is to the triangle FGL, so is the triangle BEC to the triangle GLH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AM比MC等于FN比NH,因此,三角ABE比BEC等于三角FGL比GLH;而三角ABE比FGL等于三角GLH比BEC；AM 与 MC 之比等于 FN 与 NH 之比；ABE 与 BEC 之比等于 FGL 与 GLH 之比；ABE 与 FGL 之比等于 BEC 与 GLH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1976c548e438688b64ea5ac564b3aa7b417e0994aaa925b40a074022745c532","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove, if BD, GK be joined, that, as the triangle BEC is to the triangle LGH, so also is the triangle ECD to the triangle LHK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,如果连接BD,GK,我们也可以证明,由于三角BEC是三角LGH,三角ECD也是三角LHK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb14900d14847f3babdfcb977ea3d00d3443eb546edac17a0e74e63fcf0a6c27","citations":["euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as the triangle ABE is to the triangle FGL, so is EBC to LGH, and further ECD to LHK, therefore also, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents so are all the antecedents to all the consequents; [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12) therefore, as the triangle ABE is to the triangle FGL, so is the polygon ABCDE to the polygon FGHKL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角ABE对三角FGL的比等于EBC对LGH的比,另外ECD对LHK的比,作为前奏之一,所有后果的前奏之一,也等于所有后果的前奏之一;因此,三角ABE对三角FGL的比等于多边形对多边形对FGHKL的比；ABE 与 FGL 之比等于 EBC 与 LGH 之比（相关点与线段：ABCDE） [ [V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"781713d1224f6e724327d41208a7c7160b5f5ec9b4e081e1bcb44f8dbe2d4086","citations":["euclid-6-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the triangle ABE has to the triangle FGL a ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side AB has to the corresponding side FG; for similar triangles are in the duplicate ratio of the corresponding sides. [[VI. 19](/principles/euclid-6-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,三角形ABE与三角形FGL的比是对应方AB与对应方FG的比的重复;对于类似的三角形,对应方的平方比是相同的。 [[VI. 19](/principles/euclid-6-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dffca20992d47e828659700e8853be7c1ad26d8cb1341e1eb5d37e51dfed99aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the polygon ABCDE also has to the polygon FGHKL a ratio duplicate of that which the corresponding side AB has to the corresponding side FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,多边形 ABCDE合同与相应方AB合同的多边形 FGHKL合同的比相同,与相应方FG合同的相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":25,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51212287f60f6513e6fe85f785f2c21b0350f7e7bce2fb2792c30e19768ddee1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. Similarly also it can be proved in the case of quadrilaterals that they are in the duplicate ratio of the corresponding sides. And it was also proved in the case of triangles; therefore also, generally, similar rectilineal figures are to one another in the duplicate ratio of the corresponding sides. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"乐观主义:在四边形中,同样也可以证明它们位于对应面的平方比个,三角形也证明了这一点;因此,一般来说,在对应面的平方比个之间,也存在着类似的直线数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":26,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f17c6d0e3afd9257a11d41666bc74f6d203fb79f2686a42258841a2ecf53f47a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"以三角形分相似之多边直线形则分数必等而相当之各三角形各相似其各相当两三角形之比例若两元形之比例其元形之比例为两相似边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把两个相似的直线多边形分别分成三角形时，分出的三角形个数相同，相对应的三角形彼此相似；对应三角形的面积之比等于两个多边形的面积之比。两个相似多边形的面积之比，等于它们对应边长度之比的平方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":27,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8693a82f75b5e22cb67eb1f0b05fe75fdacae46d357c64e024430b650c698a12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：此甲乙丙丁戊彼己庚辛壬癸两多边直线形其乙甲戊庚己癸两角等馀相当之各角俱等而各等角旁各两边之比例各等题先言各以角形分之其角形之分数必等而相当之各角形各相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"先解释如下：此甲乙丙丁戊彼己庚辛壬癸两多边直线形其乙甲戊庚己癸两角等馀相当之各角都等而各等角旁各两边之比例各等题先言各以三角形分之其三角形之分数必等而相当之各三角形各相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":28,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aa63dd833374aea66f715d188fef1915ef8e3ac0eeb245de2d20e6727cbf6bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试从乙甲戊庚己癸两角向各对角俱作直线为甲丙甲丁己辛己壬其元形既相似即角数等而所分角形之数亦等又乙角既与庚角等而角旁各两边之比例亦等即甲乙丙与己庚辛两角形必相似〈本篇六〉乙甲丙与庚己辛两角甲丙乙与己辛庚两角各等而各等角旁各两边之比例各等〈本篇四〉依显甲戊丁己癸壬两角形亦相似又甲丙与丙乙之比例既若己辛与辛庚而丙乙与丙丁若辛庚与辛壬〈两元形相似故〉平之即甲丙与丙丁若己辛与辛壬也〈五卷廿二〉又乙丙丁角既与庚辛壬角等而各减一相等之甲丙乙角己辛庚角即所存甲丙丁角与己辛壬角必等则甲丙丁与己辛壬两角形亦等角形亦相似矣〈本篇六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试从乙甲戊庚己癸两角向各对角都作直线为甲丙甲丁己辛己壬其元形既相似即角数等而所分三角形之数亦等又乙角既与庚角等而角旁各两边之比例亦等即甲乙丙与己庚辛两三角形必相似〈本篇六〉乙甲丙与庚己辛两角甲丙乙与己辛庚两角各等而各等角旁各两边之比例各等〈本篇四〉依显甲戊丁己癸壬两三角形亦相似又甲丙与丙乙之比例既若己辛与辛庚而丙乙与丙丁若辛庚与辛壬〈两元形相似故〉平之即甲丙与丙丁若己辛与辛壬也〈五卷廿二〉又乙丙丁角既与庚辛壬角等而各减一相等之甲丙乙角己辛庚角即所存甲丙丁角与己辛壬角必等则甲丙丁与己辛壬两三角形亦等三角形亦相似矣〈本篇六〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":29,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d89e7e4a848e88f4cde2d5455c2ec3f1bd1a73c54b61c71c4545bcccfdf5895","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"次解曰：题又言各相当角形之比例若两元形之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"次解释如下：题又言各相当三角形之比例若两元形之比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":30,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eab6cbcc77c6b90883b327dc5fe5771ab54d69651db190d8d2130b75f504d7ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙丙己庚辛两角形既相似即两形之比例为甲丙己辛两相似边再加之比例〈本篇十九〉依显甲丙丁己辛壬之比例亦为甲丙己辛再加之比例则甲乙丙与己庚辛两角形之比例若甲丙丁与己辛壬两角形之比例依显甲丁戊与己壬癸之比例亦若甲丙丁与己辛壬之比例则此形中诸角形之比例若彼形中诸角形之比例此诸形为前率彼诸形为后率而一前与一后之比例又若并前与并后之比例〈五卷十二〉即此一角形与相当彼一角形之比例若此元形与彼元形之比例矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙丙己庚辛两三角形既相似即两形之比例为甲丙己辛两相似边再加之比例〈本篇十九〉依显甲丙丁己辛壬之比例亦为甲丙己辛再加之比例则甲乙丙与己庚辛两三角形之比例若甲丙丁与己辛壬两三角形之比例依显甲丁戊与己壬癸之比例亦若甲丙丁与己辛壬之比例则此形中诸三角形之比例若彼形中诸三角形之比例此诸形为前率彼诸形为后率而一前与一后之比例又若并前与并后之比例〈五卷十二〉即此一三角形与相当彼一三角形之比例若此元形与彼元形之比例矣"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":31,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"956f71ea5e1b928789b1e72fe65ace4fbc7c9ee0b48c98579c4bc215645e38dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：题又言两多边元形之比例为两相似边再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"后解释如下：题又言两多边元形之比例为两相似边再加之比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.7","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":32,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c263d3046d357fcff6281060357701c2afd6d2b69ae53097fe323acd7851209a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙丙与己庚辛两角形之比例既若甲乙丙丁戊与己庚辛壬癸两多边形之比例而甲乙丙与己庚辛两形之比例为甲乙己庚两相似边再加之比例〈本篇十九〉则两元形亦为甲乙己庚再加之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：三角形的比例：甲乙丙 和 己庚辛 比例如下。如果多边形的比例 甲乙丙丁戊 和 己庚辛壬癸 成比例，并且 甲乙丙 和 己庚辛 的比例是 甲乙己庚，则两个相似边加上比例 〈本篇十九〉，那么二进制也为 甲乙己庚 加上比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.8","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":33,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1532649a6d3f697264a8e1ac853e5b457c59c0c89aca15b8829f735ddd3c4249","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"増题：此直线倍大于彼直线则此线上方形与彼线上方形为四倍大之比例若此方形与彼方形为四倍大之比例则此方形边与彼方形边为二倍大之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"额外问题：如果这条线是那条线的两倍，那么这条线上方的正方形与那条线上方的正方形的比例是四倍。如果这个正方形是那个正方形的四倍，那么这个正方形的一边和对面正方形的一边是两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.9","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":34,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bc576ab409ddbb1802c8a398ef519ade88f80572dbc592694208d3a21abb033","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲线倍乙线题言甲上方形与乙上方形为四倍大之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：线：甲 线乘数 乙 线命题解释：甲 的上方正方形和 乙 的上方正方形大四倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.10","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":35,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f81b7a8df79247394981d90d535c91e4ef65359b489f44e8b5e77258d73b76e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：凡直角方形俱相似〈本卷界说一〉依本题论则甲方形与乙方形之比例为甲线与乙线再加之比例甲线与乙线既为倍大之比例则两方形为四倍大之比例矣何者四倍大之比例为二倍大再加之比例若一二四为连比例故也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：所有正方形都相似。〈本卷界说一〉 根据本题，甲 与 乙 的比例是 甲 和 乙，加上线 甲 与线 乙 的比例。由于线 甲 和线 乙 大数倍，那么两个正方形大四倍。为什么比例大四倍是大两倍，如果一、二、四是连续比例？"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.11","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":36,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c59bf4853d4a8879741d9709ff371cebbb279b0dbb59e08ec3c9bdc7cf343af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：若甲上方形与乙上方形为四倍大之比例题言甲边与乙边为二倍大之比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：如果甲的上方正方形和乙的上方正方形是其四倍大，则命题解释了甲边和乙边的比例是两倍大小。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.historical.12","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":37,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"409c03e58cc115252db9cd5e36429d66e758b97d067d3b6285910453b29ae379","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：两方形四倍大之比例既为两边再加之比例则甲边二倍大于乙边系依此题可显三直线为连比例如甲乙丙则第一线上多边形与第二线上相似多边形之比例若第一线与第三线之比例此系与本篇第十九题之系同论"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：对于一个双面的四倍体，由于比例是两边加上比例，则甲的边是乙的边的两倍。根据这个问题，三条直线可以显示为连续比例。例如，甲乙丙，如果第一条线上的多边形与第二条线上的多边形相似，则第一条到第三条线的比例与本文第19题中的系统相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-20.source","contentId":"euclid-6-20","revisionId":"euclid-6-20@raw-4cf464e5108de92b","order":38,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb477f3c6245f6cbe7935a896ade2f4548de4ed0932c389c2aea2077ad5a7366","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-20:euclid-6-def-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-20.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-def-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VI. Def. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-20:euclid-6-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-20.proof.2","euclid-6-20.proof.4","euclid-6-20.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VI. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-20:euclid-6-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-20.proof.2","euclid-6-20.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VI. 4 and Def. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-20:euclid-5-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-20.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_refere